# Rust
/target
**/target
Cargo.lock.bak

# Cairo / Scarb
cairo/target
**/.snfoundry_cache
**/*.sierra.json

# Node / TS
node_modules
conformance/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# Starknet — never commit account keys. Accounts live in ~/.starknet_accounts/ by default;
# these patterns guard against an in-repo SNCAST_ACCOUNTS_FILE. deployments/*.json is PUBLIC
# (addresses/hashes only) and IS committed.
.starknet_accounts/
*_accounts.json
starknet_accounts.json

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# mainnet/testnet operator secrets — never commit (Phase 5). Ignore the real per-network env
# files + everything else under secrets/, but keep the tracked templates + README so the
# structure stays version-controlled and symmetric across networks.
secrets/*
!secrets/*.env.example
!secrets/README.md
*.env
!*.env.example
